@startuml ft-16-primerpath_10kb

actor Query
control Server
database BLASTn
database Entrez

Query -> Server: Action
activate Server
Server -> BLASTn : Send query\n- primer sequence\n- taxid list
BLASTn -> Server : blastn results (format: blast xml)
Server -> Entrez : Query gb file of the gbid
Entrez -> Server : Fetch and download Genebank file (format: gb)
Server -> Server : Parse sequence, gene, location,\n and strand of the gb
note right
Conditions:
* download the full sequence of which length < 10Kb
* download the one up/down stream of flanking genes of the HSP
end note

deactivate Server

@enduml